OL,3,GNEWSACrews work overnight to tackle
OL,4,Anature reserve fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a fire
OL,7,Fon heathland at a nature reserve
OL,8,Fovernight.
OL,10,FThe blaze on Canford Heath near Poole
OL,11,Fbroke out on Wednesday at about 20:00
OL,12,FGMT with crews from across Dorset and
OL,13,FHampshire sent in 14 firefighting
OL,14,Fappliances.
OL,16,FDorset & Wiltshire Fire and Rescue
OL,17,FService said flames had spread rapidly
OL,18,Fdue to high winds with relief crews
OL,19,Fbrought in during the early hours to
OL,20,Fdampen down.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
